    78→
    79→  /**
    80→   * Data columns sampled by the node as part of custody sampling
    81→   * https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/v1.6.0-alpha.4/specs/fulu/das-core.md#custody-sampling
    82→   *
    83→   * TODO: Consider race conditions if this updates during sync/backfill
